      "label": "Physical examination showed numerous erythematous edematous coalescing papules and plaques on the upper and lower extremities and scattered erythematous papules and plaques on the back and buttocks; some plaques were annular and polycyclic in configuration with central hyperpigmentation, while the chest, abdomen, face, and oral mucosa were clear.",
